        1817,
        2027
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "No City department or agency shall permit a representative to attend or participate in any meeting, conference or discussion pertaining to State legislation with a State official, member of the State Legislature, a Legislative Committee or State Agency unless notification is given to, and approval is received from Richard M. Rosen, Assistant to the Mayor, prior to attendance at such meeting.",
